WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.280
A video arrives with a date.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.460
A headline arrives with a number.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:07.320
Before you share either, where did the story come from?

00:00:07.571 --> 00:00:10.731
ContextTrail starts with the question you bring.

00:00:10.731 --> 00:00:14.711
It searches for sources, keeps the evidence, and gives you a

00:00:14.711 --> 00:00:16.765
trail you can read and return to.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.750
We asked about 24 billion UPI transactions in August.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:26.110
Retrieved reporting says 24.51 billion.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.670
Open the passage inside the app.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.826
Check the month, the source, and the publication date.

00:00:31.961 --> 00:00:35.831
For a clip captioned as the Satya Niketan collapse, three moments

00:00:35.831 --> 00:00:37.611
were searched separately.

00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:42.581
Reports about an older Jasola demolition appeared in the trail.

00:00:42.721 --> 00:00:46.162
Read their evidence before deciding whether they depict this clip.

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:48.047
Keep the investigation.

00:00:48.077 --> 00:00:53.227
Reopen the same source passages and frame results without searching again.

00:00:53.257 --> 00:00:55.335
Your reasoning has somewhere to live.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.360
Start a watch on a question.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.720
The first check keeps a baseline.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.470
Later checks compare newly found sources and changed passages with the

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.170
earlier investigation.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.900
Pause it whenever you need.

00:01:07.965 --> 00:01:09.345
Is this footage new?

00:01:09.385 --> 00:01:10.365
What changed?

00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:12.365
How did UPI grow?

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.445
Bring the question to ContextTrail.

00:01:14.485 --> 00:01:15.575
Open the sources.

00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:16.885
Keep what you find.
